	quest.116A74318FC9D231.title: "Craft Heavily Insulated Wire"
	quest.11EAA6665DE956FF.quest_subtitle: "&6Chutes&r are used to transfer items between inventories vertically, either with gravity downwards or Encased Fan airflow upwards"
	quest.1209EAFCD7457303.quest_subtitle: "Use an &fOil Scanner&r to check for &8Crude Oil Deposits&r from &6Create Diesel Generators&r"
	quest.12BE6BEC1BC8A0CC.title: "Obtain Iron Wires"
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.quest_desc: ["The &cKinetic Battery&r stores &6Stress Units&r for later use. This way it allows you to have a source of a limited amount of &6Stress Units&r whenever necessary without the need for a new setup each time. But to use this block for your needs first you will need to &ccharge&r it", "", "The &cKinetic Battery&r charges itself by consuming &6SU&r from the grid it is connected to whenever it &l&4is not&r powered on, and uses that charge to provide &6SU&r to the connected grid whenever &2&lit is&r powered on "]
	quest.12D0B21E10AEEDB4.title: "&5How to charge the Kinetic Battery"
	quest.13620647285BECBC.title: "Craft &7Steel Pipes&r and &6Smart Pipes&r"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_desc: ["At the bottom of the inventory, you may have noticed a search bar", "", "This is the &dJust Enough Items&r, or &dJEI&r, search bar", "", "If you type \"Wood\", for example, the &dJEI &ritem list at the right of the screen will show all items with \"Wood\" in the name", "", "Adding a @ at the start of the search query will show the items from a specific mod, for example @Create", "", "To favorite an item, press &bA &rwhile hovering over it in the &dJEI &ritem list, and it will appear in the left panel until you press &bA on it again"]
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.139DAA6E8CF4267A.title: "&bJust Enough Items (JEI)"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.quest_subtitle: "Can be used to feed the &6Blaze Forger&r and the &6Blaze Enchanter&r"
	quest.13D833C11A71B131.title: "&2Block of Experience"
	quest.14E0A5E1BA5DFA57.title: "Generating heat"
	quest.14F9238BF932A5EB.title: "&eCapture a Chicken by using the &bRoost"
	quest.156DC76AB7CD1065.quest_subtitle: "A &6Shaft&r is another basic but important machinery part that is required to make anything move with rotation. You can also extend the shaft to make it longer and affect more than one contraption that requires rotation"
	quest.156DC76AB7CD1065.title: "Rod of Constant Rotation"
	quest.157DAE6EC4155F82.quest_subtitle: "Can be found in &6caves&r."
	quest.157DAE6EC4155F82.title: "&aObtain Limestone"
	quest.160E4D26B4D8A901.title: "Materials for &3Crates"
	quest.1695EAB05715CDA0.title: "Craft Insulated Wire"
	quest.16C3EC6AE3C3F7C9.quest_desc: ["Now that we have crafted everything necessary we can finally make our &3Echo armor set&r, a powerful set that grants it's user with infinite &aResistance&r and &aStrength&r"]
	quest.16C3EC6AE3C3F7C9.title: "&bEcho Armor Set"
	quest.17336E4F60113C5C.title: "Gather Zinc Nuggets and Bulk Washing"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_desc: ["&9Tasks &rare things that need to be done to complete a quest. If a task is an item, clicking on it will show its recipe", "", "&6Rewards &rare what you get after completing all &9Tasks&r. Click to claim", "", "The pin icon at the top left will pin a quest to your screen"]
	quest.175099CF5696829E.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.175099CF5696829E.title: "&6Quests"
	quest.17E6DCDBEEBAEEAD.title: "&aMinecart"
	quest.190FD2DF12D222C0.title: "&dBar of Ruby Chocolate"
