	quest.28E2042CD660FE69.quest_subtitle: "Some fluids can be infinitely extracted from the world as long as the pool the &6Hose Pulley&r is extracting from contains 10,000 or more source blocks"
	quest.28E2042CD660FE69.title: "Bottomless Lava"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_desc: ["The icon in the top left of the screen is the &aFTB Teams &rmenu. This allows you to add other players to your team", "", "On the right of the &aFTB Teams &ricon is the &6Quest Book &ricon, which allows you to access the &6Quest Book &rat any time", "", "When you click the square at the top left of your player display, your &8Curios &rslots will become visible. Some items, such as Elytras and Totems can be equipped here"]
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.quest_subtitle: "Read my description!"
	quest.2958CA7FA6FD3E4F.title: "&2Inventory"
	quest.296F772007F1207B.title: "Welcome to &8&lPetrochem&r!"
	quest.29882BA136A365CC.title: "&eGolden Sheet"
	quest.29BC2181C9AC3A60.quest_desc: ["Needs to rotate at at least &630 RPM&r to function"]
	quest.29BC2181C9AC3A60.quest_subtitle: "A &6Mechanical Mixer&r can autocraft shapeless recipes as well as mix things like potions"
	quest.29F3FCDB8B20E164.quest_subtitle: "A gearbox with shafts on all 6 sides. Conceptually uses the same internal mechanism as Parallel Gearbox, so top and bottom spins at half speed"
	quest.29F3FCDB8B20E164.title: "&6The 6-way Gearboxes"
	quest.2A1B37D9EA24777B.quest_subtitle: "+25% Engine power +50% Fuel requirement. For when a Lava Engine just isn't enough by itself"
	quest.2A1B37D9EA24777B.title: "&aIron Boiler"
	quest.2A45646F93259D25.quest_subtitle: "The &6Gearbox&r is sort of like an extension cord, but for &6Shafts&r. It can change the direction of shafts, and can have more than one shaft attached to a different side of the gearbox"
	quest.2A5D792CD3695430.quest_subtitle: "Place near the &2Block of Experience&r during a &bthunderstorm&r."
	quest.2A5D792CD3695430.title: "&6Lighting Rod"
	quest.2AC910A3CE221B33.quest_subtitle: "A clutch that is uncoupled unless powered"
	quest.2AC910A3CE221B33.title: "&6Inverted Clutch"
	quest.2AE3E90D07A627F5.quest_subtitle: "A &6Electric Motor&r converts &6Energy (E)&r into kinetic energy (&6SU&r) at any &6RPM&r"
	quest.2AF48701F4BAB034.title: "Gather Supplies"
	quest.2B51030D87EFB0A2.quest_subtitle: "-20% Fuel requirement. For getting that little bit more juice out of your charcoal"
	quest.2B51030D87EFB0A2.title: "&aIndustrial Gears"
	quest.2B5F6A8FDF29A2F8.quest_subtitle: "The &6Schematicannon&r is a special type of machine used to build structures with the use of &6Schematics&r"
	quest.2B76FCB1361847B4.quest_subtitle: "A &6Speedometer&r lets you see the rotational speed of a kinetic network"
	quest.2BC0A0977CD94919.quest_subtitle: "Place it into a depot and wait for the Conduit Cage to convert it into Prismarine Shards."
	quest.2BC0A0977CD94919.title: "&aObtain &rFlint"
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.quest_desc: ["To use this block, first you will need to &cattach it to a workstation&r that a Villager is using. After attaching this block to a station simply &dright click it with the items you want to trade&r and the next time the Villager comes to it's station the &eDepot&r will trade the items you stored into it for you and store what the Villager trades. &aLetting you trade with Villagers without needing to be present&r"]
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.quest_subtitle: "This block allows you to &atrade with Villagers&r more conveniently"
	quest.2C770179FF6B1F73.title: "&2Trading Depot"
	quest.2C7B4EE0E160A970.title: "&6Powered Rail"
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.quest_subtitle: "Remember to cover your rods before activating... or it's going to be Chernobyl."
	quest.2C96A172ACC0226F.title: "Reactor 101"
	quest.2D0BBF1DF08E9BE4.quest_subtitle: "+50% Takeoff speed. For when you forgot to build that extra ten blocks of your runway"
	quest.2D0BBF1DF08E9BE4.title: "&aImproved Landing Gear"
	quest.2D0F4B50B4D29B55.quest_subtitle: "A &cPulse Repeater&r sends a single pulse from a continuous redstone signal after a configurable amount of time"
	quest.2D6CCA806E1A76CD.quest_subtitle: "A &cPulse Extender&r extends a pulse to a configurable duration"
	quest.2E31F85F781C4BCC.quest_desc: ["This amazing tool lets you &ahook yourself to a block and swing from it&r gaining momentum along the way and letting you launch yourself and get enough distance to hook yourself &ato the next block&r", "", "You can even enchant it with the &dImpact enchantment&r to deal damage to whoever dares to get in your way", "", "&o&8You can pair these with the&r &aSlime Boots&r &o&8and go even faster"]
	quest.2E31F85F781C4BCC.title: "&dGrapplin Whisk"
	quest.2F4D033C31346B10.quest_subtitle: "Displays text or items in a hologram style"
	quest.2F4D033C31346B10.title: "&aHologram Source"
	quest.2FCF57E09D4BB840.quest_subtitle: "A &6Cart Assembler&r allows for contraptions that traverse rails in the same way minecarts do"
	quest.2FDFF69D73F47CF8.quest_subtitle: "Fast-firing cannon fueled with gunpowder"
	quest.2FDFF69D73F47CF8.title: "&aRotary Cannon"
	quest.3013102F588F3BB7.quest_subtitle: "A &6Clockwork Bearing&r lets you create your own custom functional clock"
	quest.302167AFA048184F.quest_subtitle: "After crafting your first Chicken Sandwich, you gain access to a wide range of custom sandwich recipes, allowing you to create your own unique burgers"
	quest.302167AFA048184F.title: "&eMake a &3Burger"
	quest.309779606351AC6A.quest_subtitle: "Stores kinetic stress for later use. Retains charge in item form to enable long-distance energy transport. Battery capacity, RPM at discharge and stress impact values are all configurable"
	quest.309779606351AC6A.title: "&cKinetic Battery"
	quest.30C1D45E7545FA6C.quest_subtitle: "Connect with a heat source into a boiler heater, spreads heat across all pipes evenly unless pumped."
	quest.30CF131DFA9D542D.quest_subtitle: "Transfer stress capacity from one network to another while keeping the networks separate. Guarantees that the source network will not be affected when the destination network is overstressed"
	quest.30CF131DFA9D542D.title: "&bKinetic Bridge"
	quest.30D5CEA810CE1978.quest_subtitle: "A &6Spout&r is used for filling items with fluids and crafting certain items using fluids"
	quest.30D7DB66D96F6059.quest_subtitle: "\"I am you, but stronger.\""
	quest.3103AA1D921B71BC.quest_subtitle: "As the name implies, &aSuper Glue&r allows you to glue blocks together. Particularly useful when making contraptions"
	quest.3103AA1D921B71BC.title: "&aSuper Glue"
	quest.313B89CDDEC26A69.quest_subtitle: "A &6Train Observer&r gives off a &credstone&r signal when detecting a train"
	quest.3151475431766DAF.quest_subtitle: "A &6Brass Funnel&r allows for filtering and higher stack sizes"
	quest.31CC7F2DE56B10CD.quest_subtitle: "A &6Brass Tunnel&r is an upgrade to the &6Andesite Tunnel&r, allowing more configurability in how to deal with items"
	quest.3207FC214E81882A.quest_subtitle: "When placed in front of the &6Encased Fan&r, &9water&r allows it to wash items"
	quest.323F20F8AFC2C633.title: "&cMinecart with TNT"
	quest.326B2F79F3A9D8D7.quest_subtitle: "Produce more than 1000 &fTrain Tracks&r with the same Mechanical Press"
	quest.326B2F79F3A9D8D7.title: "&6Track Factory"
	quest.326BB81BA22F0E4E.title: "&d&lWelcome to the Fun Section"
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.quest_desc: ["Obtained by filling a piece of &aCoal or a Charcoal&r with a &6Spout filled with Lava&r"]
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.quest_subtitle: "Who in the world needs this much fuel"
	quest.334E09BB534F212D.title: "&2Fiery Coal&r and &2Fiery Charcoal&r"
