	quest.337BA8FE36665B99.title: "&cSequenced Pulse Generator"
	quest.33B3C5F33B18C4F3.title: "&eTrain Casing"
	quest.34B833D58C45952C.quest_desc: ["The next step begins by &6heating&r a blaze burner that sits directly below a &aBasin&r and in that basin we are going to be compacting an &aEgg&r, a piece of &eSugar&r and lastly our &dSculk Flour&r which will give us a beatiful &dEcho Cake Base&r which will be used in the next step of our process"]
	quest.34B833D58C45952C.title: "&eEcho Cake Base"
	quest.34BDEA7471099252.title: "&dMinecart with Furnace"
	quest.34FF589B697722F3.quest_subtitle: "It's just a &6Seat&r, nothing more, nothing less. But if you're in a moving contraption, you might as well glue it to the contraption so you can sit and move along with it"
	quest.34FF589B697722F3.title: "Seat"
	quest.356481588F239F15.title: "&9Fan Haunting Catalyst"
	quest.3579EE70549D6DBF.quest_subtitle: "An upgraded version of the &6Copper Diving Helmet&r"
	quest.35C8929631187831.quest_subtitle: "A &6Packager&r will pack items from the connected inventory into a package when given &credstone&r power"
	quest.3619EEA1236FDB0F.quest_subtitle: "Crash into another &bTrain&r while driving backwards"
	quest.3619EEA1236FDB0F.title: "Blind Spot"
	quest.36668621669EDF51.quest_desc: ["Now that we obtained some &dEcho Shards&r it's now time for us to liquefy them using a &bsuper-heated&r blaze burner and a &6Mechanical Mixer&r setup to obtain some very pretty looking &3Molten Echo", "", "&l-&r If you don't know how to super-heat you can feed our blaze burner a &6Blaze cake&r or give them a &fStraw&r so that you can make them drink some delicious &cLava&r you can find out how to do both of these things by following the &bCreate&r chapter of the questbook."]
	quest.36668621669EDF51.title: "&bMolten Echo Bucket"
	quest.36B4BBB6EB3B49E2.quest_subtitle: "Finally you can craft it."
	quest.36B4BBB6EB3B49E2.title: "&aCraft &dTrident"
	quest.36D50A6AFFF2346F.quest_subtitle: "Nautilus Shells can be obtained from the ocean, or by bulk washing or channeling suspicious rocks."
	quest.36D50A6AFFF2346F.title: "&aObtain &eNautilus Shell"
	quest.36ECE457C7EB0613.quest_desc: ["Now that we have our liquid metal we are gonna need something strong enough to handle it luckily for us the &6Netherite ingot&r is just the ore for this job"]
