	quest.52E043CA3F3DADF1.quest_desc: ["&6&lCreate&r offers great guides for most of its items by hovering over them in &d&lJEI&r or in your inventory and holding down &eW&r to &bponder&r the item, but sometimes it's best just to test each thing out", "", "{image:allofcreate:textures/qb_image1.png width:397 height:140 align:center fit:true}", "", "Because of this, this chapter is mostly focused on letting you know what exists and giving you a rough outline of the progression of the mod, but at the same time, it will not handhold you all the way to the end since &6&lCreate&r is a sandbox mechanic mod"]
