	quest.606349BB488D2422.quest_desc: ["Now that you have the necessary materials we can start by crafting ourselves a couple of &bHypertube Block&r after you put down one of them you can &aright click it while having another one in your hand&r to extend the tube to wherever you please as long as the angle isn't too steep and that there aren't any blocks in between", "", "Now that we have our tunnel we will need to connect a &bHypertube Entrance Block&r that is connected to a powered grid via a cogwheel to let ourself enter the tunnel, keep in mind though the speed at which you enter the tunnel is dependent on the &6RPM (Rounds per minute)&r that the cogwheel spins at so if you wan't to go &9sonic-speed&r you will need to crank that speed up to as high as it goes", "", "And lastly we have the &bHypertube Accelerator Block&r which speeds up entities that passes through the block inside the tunnel to &ahigh speeds&r which increases it's speed depending on how much &6RPM&r it spins at", "", "You can also right-click the block and put it on &aBrake Mode&r which will instead slow down entities, but who even wants to brake in the first place"]
	quest.606349BB488D2422.title: "&b&lThe Hypertube"
	quest.622B5B4CD721D8B8.quest_subtitle: "Propogate the beam perpendicularly and &arotate the mirror&r to choose where to propogate"
	quest.622B5B4CD721D8B8.title: "&6Encased Mirror"
