	quest.6A52090D6BC064D7.quest_desc: ["This tutorial will guide you through some basic features. Don't worry, it won't take &otoo &rlong.", "", "To start, click the checkmark under the word \"&9Tasks&r\" and then claim the &6Quest Reward&r. New quests will start to appear.", "", "If new quests do not start appearing, try rejoining your world. Do not eat the bread until the tutorial is finished!"]
